    "title": "L1 bounded-polarity growing-cofactor marked full-pencil reduction",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "If polarized entropy p<ell and d>ell+p-1, a maximal-sunflower residual has at least two dense petals. For the canonical two largest dense supports, clearing their missing sets gives L_Ti C_i-L_Tj C_j=(c_j-c_i)FJ with deg J<=p and deg C_i,deg C_j<=d-ell+p, retaining exact-defect coprimality. For fixed p the petal-pair/mark census is polynomial, so the bounded-p branch is reduced injectively to bounded-mark deformations of the full-petal split-pencil identity, uniformly in growing cofactor excess.",
